yan  Reynolds and the creative team that have  been put behind this that they  understand how to make  character work because he is it is  possible to do him wrong he can be  grading if overplayed if you don't dose  him just right and having cable there to  be the straight man probably a good way  to balance it so I think this is gonna  be a fun raucous  obscene time at the movies and I expect  I'll get that number seven New Mutants  now at this point I feel the need to  clarify this is not a ranking of which I  think will be the best movies of 2018  this is simply a ranking of my own level  of excitement so before you go me how  could you possibly think New Mutants  will be better than Deadpool - it's not  that I think that it's just that I'm  more excited to see what it is cuz the  thing about Deadpool - is I have a  pretty good sense of what that's gonna  be New Mutants I don't know what it's  gonna be I know what the trailers are  selling me and I am super intrigued by  that could it go off the rails yeah  absolutely  this could go way off the rails but I'm  really curious to see this flat out sort  of teenage haunted Asylum horror movie  looking thing with Butte ins  I'm really curious I'm excited to see  what the results are again fully aware  of the fact that this could completely  fall apart but yeah this this is a  prospect that really excites me because  I get excited by new directions for  superhero movies cuz I think it's the  best way to keep the genre going is by  not having them all be the same and this  is really different number six  Elita battle angel now I did my review  of the first trailer out and I had a few  reservations and I still have them but  seriously I've been waiting on for this  movie for a long long time and I also  feel the need to clarify it for some  reason people saw my video talking about  the trailer and they got the impression  that I seen the OVA but not read the  manga I've read the MA I have the first  three volumes of the 